  "content": "\n\n<h1><strong>Code Geass Crystal PvP + 動漫天空 by levikk</strong></h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PtBETfB.gif\" alt=\"1\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>自訂介面</li>\n<li>圖騰</li>\n<li>天空覆蓋層</li>\n<li>自訂劍</li>\n<li>物品貼圖</li>\n<li>小型物品</li>\n<li>音效</li>\n<li>附魔光澤</li>\n<li>水晶</li>\n</ul>\n<p>若要顯示天空效果，您需要安裝以下任一模組：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" rel=\"nofollow\">Optifine</a>（適用於 Forge）或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skyboxify\" rel=\"nofollow\">Skyboxify</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nuit\" rel=\"nofollow\">FabricSkyBoxes</a> 以及 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nuit-interop\" rel=\"nofollow\">FabricSkyBoxes Interop</a>（適用於 Fabric）</p>",
